# --- Third-party datasets: NEVER commit these (see ARCHITECTURE.md §8) ---
databaseAudio/
**/audio_extracted/
**/audio_extracted_16k/
**/final_utterance_videos/
**/MUStARD_Plus_Plus-main/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4

# --- Derived artifacts: spectrograms, trained weights, caches ---
artifacts/spectrograms/**/*.png
artifacts/models/*.keras
artifacts/models/*.h5
artifacts/manifests/*.parquet
artifacts/manifests/*.csv
# .npz caught 2026-09-06, at the git-init dry run, one step before actually committing
# 68MB of cached RAVDESS/MUStARD++ spectrogram feature arrays (build_features.py's
# output) to a public repo — the exact ADR-016 violation this file exists to prevent.
artifacts/manifests/*.npz
artifacts/reports/*.png
# Local run logs (uvicorn/training stdout) — never anything a clone needs, and never
# audited for what a candidate's transcript or an absolute local path might contain.
artifacts/reports/*.log
*.pkl
*.p

# --- Live interview sessions and their per-turn images: real (or RAVDESS-derived)
# speech, transcripts, and Grad-CAM/spectrogram PNGs, not code (found 2026-09-05 while
# building the web capture endpoint, ADR-041 — this was never covered, and the repo
# was one `git init` away from being able to commit a candidate's own transcript) ---
artifacts/sessions/*.json
artifacts/turn_artifacts/**/*.png

# --- Secrets ---
.env
*.env.local

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Keep manifests' schemas visible but not bulk data ---
!artifacts/manifests/.gitkeep
!artifacts/metrics/.gitkeep

# --- Deliberate exception: the ONE synthetic demo session, so a fresh clone shows a
# populated dashboard with no API key and no training run. Built by
# scripts/build_demo_session.py from RAVDESS Actor_01 (CC BY-NC-SA) with a SCRIPTED,
# non-verbatim transcript — attributed and marked non-commercial in README.md. This is
# the only exception to the session/artifact block above; every other session stays
# excluded (README.md decision, 2026-09-05) ---
!artifacts/sessions/demo_session_001.json
!artifacts/turn_artifacts/demo_session_001/
!artifacts/turn_artifacts/demo_session_001/*.png
